    "learningOutcome": "Students interpret sample data.",
    "type": "Knowledge",
    "text": "A census is the collection of data from an entire population.",
    "sourcePage": 14,
    "source": "Alberta Draft Mathematics (7–9) Curriculum, June 2026, ©2026 Government of Alberta | Education and Childcare; Draft Curriculum: Optional Classroom Piloting in 2026–27"
