    "type": "Knowledge",
    "text": "Function notation includes\n• a letter to name the function, followed by the input value in parentheses, e.g., f(x)\n• the input value, e.g., x\n• the output value, e.g., f(x)\n• the function rule, e.g., 2x + 3",
    "sourcePage": 9,
