    "guidingQuestion": "How can forces relate to changes in movement?",
    "learningOutcome": "Students investigate and explain how forces affect the movement of objects.",
    "type": "Knowledge",
    "text": "Contact forces include forces that are\n• applied by a person or an object on another object (applied)\n• caused by objects, surfaces, or substances sliding against each other (friction)\n• applied by pulling on a string or rope connected to an object (tension)\n• caused by a compressed or stretched object or spring (elastic or spring)",
